    },
    {
      "text": "Oui, un *cheval*.",
      "image": "horsehead",
      "tag": "laughs",
      "bg": "red",
      "rays": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Rome, an *37*.",
      "image": "email",
      "bg": "dark",
      "date": "37 APR. J.-C.",
      "tag": "curious"
    },
    {
      "text": "Le nouvel empereur : *Caligula*.",
      "image": "bronze",
      "bg": "dark",
      "label": "CALIGULA",
      "tag": "mischievously"
    },
    {
      "text": "Son chouchou ? Un cheval de course : *Incitatus* !",
      "image": "course",
      "bg": "dark",
      "tag": "excited"
    },
    {
      "text": "Il lui offre une écurie en *marbre* !",
      "image": "horse2",
      "bg": "dark",
      "tag": "excited"
    },
    {
      "text": "Une mangeoire en *ivoire* !",
      "image": "horse1",
      "bg": "dark",
      "tag": "laughs"
    },
    {
      "text": "Un collier de pierres *précieuses* !",
      "image": "cameo",
      "bg": "dark",
      "tag": "sarcastic"
    },
    {
      "text": "Et même une *maison*, avec des esclaves !",
      "image": "plaque",
      "tag": "laughs",
      "bg": "red",
      "rays": true
    },
    {
      "text": "La veille des courses…",
      "image": "head",
      "bg": "dark",
      "zoom": true,
      "tag": "whispers",
      "sfx": [
        "whisper"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "des soldats imposent le *SILENCE* dans tout le quartier… pour que le cheval dorme !",
      "image": "amph1",
      "bg": "dark",
      "stamp": "CHUT !",
      "tag": "excited"
    },
    {
      "text": "Selon Dion Cassius, il lui sert de l'orge en *or* !",
      "image": "amph2",
      "bg": "dark",
      "tag": "laughs"
    },
    {
      "text": "Et il promet d'en faire un *CONSUL* !",
      "image": "chevaux",
      "stamp": "CONSUL",
      "tag": "excited",
      "bg": "red",
      "rays": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Folie ? Ou *moquerie* ?",
      "image": "marble",
      "bg": "dark",
      "zoom": true,
      "tag": "curious"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour beaucoup d'historiens, il voulait *humilier* le Sénat.",
      "image": "sest",
      "bg": "dark",
      "tag": "mischievously"
    },
    {
      "text": "Comme pour dire : même mon cheval ferait mieux que *VOUS* !",
      "image": "horsehead",
      "tag": "sarcastic",
      "bg": "red",
      "rays": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Incitatus ne sera jamais consul. Caligula est *assassiné*… à vingt-huit ans.",
      "image": "pale",
      "bg": "dark",
      "date": "41 APR. J.-C.",
      "tag": "dramatically"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cet empereur voulait faire de son cheval…",
